@startuml
!theme cyborg
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam defaultFontColor #F3F4F6
title AFTER MVP — Proposed revision-bound merge and reconciliation
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam shadowing false

actor "Authorized caller" as U
participant "Git collaboration handler" as H
database "PR / review / attempt metadata" as DB
participant "Evaluated native Git adapter" as G
U -> H : explicit merge intent + expected context
H -> H : current authority / command identity
H -> G : read exact source / target revisions
G --> H : actual native context
H -> DB : inspect revision-bound review / checks
DB --> H : actual evidence
H -> DB : record attributable intended mutation
H -> G : candidate integration + guarded expected-ref update
note over H,G
 Concrete protocol must revalidate source/target/policy preconditions.
 Target compare alone does not serialize every policy dependency.
end note
alt native result known
 G --> H : confirmed update / conflict / failure evidence
 H -> DB : record actual PR / attempt observation
else result or metadata completion lost
 H -> DB : retain partial / unknown coordination state
 note over H,G
 Reconcile actual refs for the same attributable attempt.
 No blind repeated merge or automatic target deployment.
 end note
end
H --> U : permitted actual outcome
@enduml
